>So I have to levitate in the plane of water to stay in the bubble and avoid 
>drowning?

No. If you enter the plane of water without levitation, you appear
inside a bubble and can move normally within your bubble and move from
bubble to bubble when they touch each other.

If you start levitating, you take yourself out of the bubble as well as
out of the water, and you can't see where the bubbles are any more.
